---
title: Lifecycle supervisor · ownership and recovery
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Absent
  Absent --> Starting : Reserve [locks acquired]
  Starting --> Running : Spawn [identity durable]
  Starting --> Exited : StartFailure
  Running --> Recoverable : SupervisorDeath
  Recoverable --> Recoverable : Retry [duplicate refused]
  Running --> Orphaned : GuardDeath [members live]
  Recoverable --> Orphaned : GuardDeath [members live]
  Recoverable --> Stopping : Stop [identity matches]
  Orphaned --> Stopping : RecoverStop [exact witness; capture members]
  Orphaned --> StopUnknown : RecoverStop [identity unconfirmed]
  Running --> Stopping : Stop [identity matches]
  Running --> Exited : Reap [no live members]
  Stopping --> Exited : Reap [no live members]
  Stopping --> KillPending : Kill [grace elapsed]
  Stopping --> Stopping : WitnessExit [captured identities retained]
  KillPending --> Exited : Reap [no live members]
  KillPending --> StopUnknown : StopUnknown [members live]
  note right of Starting
    INV identity precedes command
  end note
  note right of Orphaned
    Unknown health retains ownership
    No exact witness refuses capture
    Live session refuses duplicate
  end note
